    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d740">

                <pb facs="0578" n="496" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg496"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Provisional President de la Barra to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-28"><hi rendition="#italic">May 28,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Thanking you most earnestly for your friendly felicitations, I send you the most
                    cordial wishes for the personal happiness of yourself, whom I hold in the most
                    sincere regard, and for the welfare of the American Government and people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">de la Barra.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
